    {
      "key": "privacy.cloudBody",
      "source": "关闭时不自动连接你的云盘，也不进行云盘读写、个人资料与组织/好友同步、云端 OH 记忆或基于云盘的分享。授权后会读取账号、配额、资料库和所打开文件，并为同步、好友、组织、口令分享等功能创建或更新对应资料库与文件；主动上传、删除、共享操作也会修改云盘。不会因为同意本许可就清空或批量改动原有文件，授权也不等于允许 OH 随意操作文件。",
      "kind": "text",
      "parameters": [],
      "locations": [
        {
          "file": "docs/i18n/static-label-seed.json",
          "line": 1
        }
      ],
      "translation": "When disabled, OneTHU does not automatically connect to your cloud account or perform cloud reads/writes, profile/organization/friend sync, cloud OH memory or cloud-based sharing. When enabled, it can read account details, quota, libraries and files you open, and create or update relevant libraries/files for sync, friends, organizations and passphrase sharing. Upload, deletion and sharing actions also change cloud data. Giving consent does not clear or bulk-modify existing files, nor authorize arbitrary OH file operations.",
      "status": "prefilled-review",
      "limitHint": "Preserve meaning; do not truncate."
    },
