          "line": 1
        }
      ],
      "translation": "This is an unofficial assistance tool. University APIs, networks and third-party services may change or become unavailable; data may be delayed, incomplete or incorrect. Check deadlines, reservations, payments and other important matters in official systems, and verify action results. Back up important files. This notice does not exclude statutory rights or responsibilities.",
