      "limitHint": "Preserve meaning; do not truncate."
    },
    {
      "key": "privacy.localBody",
      "source": "OneTHU 没有自建的校园数据汇总后端，界面与业务主要在设备上运行，并通过原生网络层连接学校及你选择的服务。它并非离线软件，也不是所有处理都只发生在本机。账号会话、缓存、设置及选择记住的凭据会保存在设备上，请保护设备与导出的文件。",
      "kind": "text",
      "parameters": [],
      "locations": [
        {
          "file": "docs/i18n/static-label-seed.json",
          "line": 1
        }
      ],
      "translation": "OneTHU has no self-operated backend that aggregates campus data. Its interface and most application logic run on your device, with a native network layer connecting to university services and services you select. It is not offline, and not all processing stays on-device. Sessions, caches, settings and credentials you choose to remember are stored on your device. Protect your device and exported files.",
      "status": "prefilled-review",
      "limitHint": "Preserve meaning; do not truncate."
